==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈtʰaːlar̥ θuː/}}
{{rfap|is}}

===Etymology===
From {{m|is|talar||you speak}} the second person singular form of {{m|is|tala||to speak}} + {{m|is|þú||you}} + the [[singular]] [[indefinite article]] [[accusative]] form of the language in question.

===Phrase===
{{head|is|phrase|head=[[tala#Icelandic|talar]] [[þú#Icelandic|þú]]...?}}

# (with accusative) do [[you]] [[speak]]...?

